URL:https://citp.princeton.edu/events/2026/liat-krawczyk-ai-innovation-ai-d
 eployment-building-institutions-ai-driven-economy
LOCATION:Sherrerd Hall 306
SUMMARY:Liat Krawczyk - From AI Innovation to AI Deployment: Building the I
 nstitutions for an AI-Driven Economy
CLASS:PUBLIC
DESCRIPTION:Artificial intelligence is advancing faster than the institutio
 ns\, workforces\, and systems expected to absorb it. The challenge ahead i
 s therefore not only one of technological innovation\, but of deployment: 
 how do we translate rapidly evolving capabilities into broad-based economi
 c opportunity\, institutional capacity\, and public benefit?This talk will
  explore the New Jersey AI Hub as an emerging model for tackling that chal
 lenge. A public-private initiative founded by Princeton University\, the S
 tate of New Jersey\, Microsoft\, and CoreWeave\, the Hub brings together u
 niversities\,
CATEGORIES:Artificial Intelligence, Data Science & Society
