URL:https://citp.princeton.edu/events/2026/shira-zilberstein-code-care-mora
 lization-healthcare-machine-learning
LOCATION:Sherrerd Hall 306
SUMMARY:Shira Zilberstein - From Code to Care: The Moralization of Healthca
 re Machine Learning
CLASS:PUBLIC
DESCRIPTION:Artificial intelligence is widely promoted as a promising solut
 ion to healthcare challenges\, yet its clinical benefits still remain unce
 rtain and its risks persistent. Drawing on extensive fieldwork with resear
 chers developing machine-learning applications for healthcare\, this talk 
 demonstrates how practitioners sustain AI’s legitimacy by framing their 
 work as serving the common good. It is argued that “moralization”—th
 e work of aligning technological projects with values such as equity\, car
 e\, and wellbeing—generates consensus and momentum for technological sol
 utions to social problems amid
CATEGORIES:Artificial Intelligence, Data Science & Society
