 gence (AI) are taking on ever more (and ever more foundational) roles in t
 he routine course of science. AI-based tools are projected to transform ev
 ery stage of the research pipeline\, from literature review and hypothesis
  generation\, to the production of synthetic data and data analysis. Incre
 asingly\, with the rise of generative AI\, AI tools are also put forward a
